        "created_at": "2024-10-29T14:07:43.134Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cause it’s Guise, Guise, Guise!</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-298-writers-room-the-guise-book-18-20\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-298-writers-room-the-guise-book-18-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-298-writers-room-the-guise-book-18-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #298 - Writers' Room: The Guise Book #18-20</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The Delusional Comedy!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:47:16 Guise is back! And he's extra ridiculous! As per usual! We find our hero in unexpected realms accompanied by a mysterious guide and dealing with Guise's worst nemeses: the consequences of his...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hpP2qMs79FHM7dG2eOHUKtckHJ6\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7a103cb2b5bb8c41f8be7bb0d48857d7e5192b98_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 579 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
