        "id": 261364,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-10-29T17:14:27.669Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Adam: “wHy My ShOuLdErS hUrT?”</p>\n<p>It’s good to hear Christopher is also experiencing the Largeness of Freedom Five.</p>\n<p>“And today’s episode is about the consequences of that story!” Great intro, perfect comedic timing. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>“Hey, guys, it’s time!” “Who are you talking to, it’s just me here!”</p>\n<p>Ah! That’s why the throne looks the way it does on the cover. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Worst power origin ever! Love it.</p>\n<p>Excuse me, poop jokes are <em>always</em> appropriate. &gt;:B</p>\n<p>“This is terrible and stupid, I love it!” Now that’s a writing philosophy I can follow. XD</p>\n<p>“This is the Guise vore issue.” And that is not! :’)</p>\n<p>This is just the weirdest, freakiest issue ever, good choice for Halloweek.</p>\n<p>It’s very interesting that Wager Master is the one going through character growth here. Like… who could have seen that coming?</p>\n<p>I have to assume the relic being asked about is the Atlantean Conduit?</p>\n<p>Wild sound effects on this one.</p>\n<p>I’ve never felt so unthanked before! XD</p>",
