        "raw": "Adam: \"wHy My ShOuLdErS hUrT?\"\n\nIt's good to hear Christopher is also experiencing the Largeness of Freedom Five.\n\n\"And today's episode is about the consequences of that story!\" Great intro, perfect comedic timing. :smiley: \n\n\"Hey, guys, it's time!\" \"Who are you talking to, it's just me here!\"\n\nAh! That's why the throne looks the way it does on the cover. :smiley: \n\nWorst power origin ever! Love it.\n\nExcuse me, poop jokes are *always* appropriate. >:B\n\n\"This is terrible and stupid, I love it!\" Now that's a writing philosophy I can follow. XD\n\n\"This is the Guise vore issue.\" And that is not! :')\n\nThis is just the weirdest, freakiest issue ever, good choice for Halloweek.\n\nIt's very interesting that Wager Master is the one going through character growth here. Like... who could have seen that coming?\n\nI have to assume the relic being asked about is the Atlantean Conduit?\n\nWild sound effects on this one.\n\nI've never felt so unthanked before! XD",
